  "contentHtml": "<p>#물 #분자 #분자모형<br><br>--------------------아래에 설명을 추가해주세요^^</p><p>유명한 과학짤을 보여주고, 분자모형 만들기 키트를 주고 창의적인 과학짤을 만들어 띵커벨 보드에 올리라고 했습니다.</p><p>핸드폰이 있으니, 수업시간에 바로 올리기 좋네요.<br>띵커벨 보드를 학생 이름 별로 카드로 만들어 아이들 포트폴리오로 쓰고 있어요.&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/35d66774fba2643d886e63e4a8fde8f505a1c4bb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/35d66774fba2643d886e63e4a8fde8f505a1c4bb\" data-origin-width=\"461\" data-origin-height=\"729\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b6974156abcf29e293751bfe6c465e6fb807ba33\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b6974156abcf29e293751bfe6c465e6fb807ba33\" data-origin-width=\"266\" data-origin-height=\"360\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/815908be5635cdbf94915a7a8d164c1b339f4bea\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/815908be5635cdbf94915a7a8d164c1b339f4bea\" data-origin-width=\"281\" data-origin-height=\"515\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/206b3585651c2c8ecd007718c4e06259184d7ffc\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/206b3585651c2c8ecd007718c4e06259184d7ffc\" data-origin-width=\"280\" data-origin-height=\"490\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
